    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n80905" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πέπερῐ</span></b> , τό, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>pepper, Piper nigrum</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Antiph.
				277
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Po.</u>
				1458a15
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				2.159
			</span></i>, etc.: gen. 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πεπέρεως</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					<u>Sull.</u>
					13
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Ath.
				9.381b
			</span></i> ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πεπέριος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Thphr.
					<u>HP</u>
					9.20.2
				</span></i>
			 : pl., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ τρία πεπέρια</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Orib.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					67
				</span></i>
			 : other forms imply nom. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πέπερις</span></b> , ὁ, gen. 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοῦ πεπέριδος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Eub.
					128
				</span></i>
			 ; dat. 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πεπέριδι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ael.
					<u>NA</u>
					9.48
				</span></i>
			 ; acc. 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πέπεριν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Nic.
					<u>Al.</u>
					332
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Th.</u>
				876
			</span></i>; gen. pl. 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πεπερίδων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ath.
					9.376d
				</span></i>
			: also fem., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἱ πεπέριδες</span>
			<i>pepper-trees</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Philostr.
				<u>VA</u>
				3.4
			</span></i>. </div>
